  "paragraph": 28,
  "text": "Once you master a complete single-agent harness, you are ready for Pillar Five, the next level: subagents, delegation, and scale. Despite all the hype about AI personas role-playing as executives and junior developers, the real engineering reason harnesses like Claude Code, OpenCode, Cline, and Roo Code spawn subagents is context hygiene. Suppose you delegate a forty-file codebase search to an isolated child agent. Tens of thousands of tokens of messy grep output stay sealed inside the child window, returning only a crisp summary to the parent orchestrator.",
